    "GroupType" : 0,
    "GroupTypeName" : "MSG_GROUP_TYPE_NONE",
    "MsgData" : [ {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 2,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Ah, Ser Arisen!\r\n'Tis good... I've aught I must tell you!",
        "Jp" : "ああ、覚者さん！\r\nよかった、あんたに言わないと\r\nいけないことがあるんだよ！"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 516413,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 3,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Aye, the Tarasque showed itself!\r\nHeard from Razanailt yet?\r\nThought to catch a rabbit or two...\r\nStepped outside, and the ground started rumbling—!",
        "Jp" : "そう、タラスクが出たんだ！\r\nもうラザネイルさんに聞いたかい？\r\n野ウサギでも獲ろうと思って\r\n外に出たら地鳴りがして――！"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 552358,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 4,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "'Twas something mountain-sized moving at\r\n<SPOT 923>. Came tearing\r\nback in a fright, I did!",
        "Jp" : "《<SPOT 923>》で山みたいに大きな\r\nものが動いてるのを見て\r\n慌てて帰ってきたんだ！"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 552359,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 5,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "And that Tarasque... seemed different from the\r\none before— Anyway, 'tis massive, \r\nand looks ferocious!\r\nAt this rate, it'll trample the \r\nwhole village flat!",
        "Jp" : "それに、前に見たタラスクとは\r\nなんだか様子が違ったような――\r\nとにかく大きくて凶暴そうなんだ！\r\nこのままじゃ村ごと踏み潰されちまうよ！"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 552360,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    } ],
    "NameDispOff" : false,
    "NpcId" : 2509,
    "NpcName" : {
      "En" : "Orla",
      "Jp" : "オリア"
    }
  }, {
    "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgGroup",
    "GroupNameSerial" : 0,
    "GroupSerial" : 19343,
    "GroupType" : 0,
    "GroupTypeName" : "MSG_GROUP_TYPE_NONE",
    "MsgData" : [ {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 6,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "I saw something as gargantuan as a mountain\r\nmoving at <SPOT 923>!\r\n'Twas different from the Tarasque I saw afore—",
        "Jp" : "《<SPOT 923>》で山みたいに大きな\r\nものが動いてるのを見たんだよ！\r\n前に見たタラスクとは\r\nなんだか様子が違ったように思うけど――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 516414,
      "MsgType" : 0,
